From 9ab2bf576abe0d4638864bc0ca8a0a8127cbc5af Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: daveey <daveey@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 13:01:39 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] [daveey] CLI park --wake-check refuses an inline secret like
 the tool path (wake_check_secret)

PR #1354 made the kanban tools refuse a wake_check the display redactor
would change: a probe runs exactly as stored, so masking it breaks it and
keeping it puts the secret on the board. `hermes kanban block/schedule
--wake-check` normalized and dry-ran the probe but had no such refusal, so
an inline `OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-...` probe was stored and run verbatim.

The check moves to hermes_cli/kanban_wake_check_secret.py; the tool path
(_wake_check_secret_error) and _cli_wake_check both call it before the dry
run executes the probe. A CLI park with an inline secret exits 2 with
wake_check_secret and stores nothing; an idempotency_key='review:...' probe
is still stored byte-identical. Follow-up from review t_01a1cf56c1c4cc35.
---
 hermes_cli/kanban_cli_park.py                 |   4 +
 hermes_cli/kanban_wake_check_secret.py        |  36 ++++++
 .../test_kanban_cli_probe_secret.py           | 106 ++++++++++++++++++
 tools/kanban_tools_park_args.py               |  29 +----
 4 files changed, 151 insertions(+), 24 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 hermes_cli/kanban_wake_check_secret.py
 create mode 100644 tests/hermes_cli/test_kanban_cli_probe_secret.py

